 "last_text": "The match is over and I finished first with a score of about 5705; second place (gemini-4-argon) had about 842.\n\n- **Early lead:** hand-wired sugar-tracking brains on radius-6 and radius-4 bodies took most of the sugar by tick 1500 and peaked near 8800 biomass around tick 2500.\n- **Mid-match crash:** from about tick 4000 enemy attacks, most likely gemini's organisms, killed my unarmoured small organisms, dropping me to 1780 biomass at tick 5000 while gemini briefly passed me in live biomass.\n- **Recovery:** radius-5 \"warden\" organisms with full spikes and a jaw, plus a spiked variant of the small body, cleared the vents. Gemini fell to zero and I was back at roughly 7000\u20138000 biomass for the last 3000 ticks.\n- **What didn't work:** every larger or more efficient body I released (radius 7\u201310) starved or died out, and about a third of the budget went on them."
